{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1150278,\"title\":\"Supersisters\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Teenage Ala does not fit into the provincial world around her. She constantly rebels and acts out against her father, a physics teacher at the local school. When Ala accidentally discovers that she has superpowers and meets her sister Lena, whom she didn’t know existed, her life turns upside down – literally. The trail of girls endowed with supernatural powers is followed by the Colonel and his dangerous companion Hector from the secret Department 92. The goal of the soldiers is to create a powerful new generation weapon. To get it they are willing to sacrifice a lot, even the lives of sisters. After years of separation, will Ala and Lena be able to join forces and cooperate? Will the supersisters move to rescue not only each other, but also the world?\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lIb1Ac5GiH6Jb30ocUHFkboEBTp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/crJ5M1wNsjsZMe0d2wyNqpKp4yc.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"voteCount\":3,\"year\":2024,\"runtime\":105,\"genres\":[\"Science Fiction\",\"Adventure\",\"Family\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"PL\",\"name\":\"Poland\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Maciej Barczewski\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":2055172,\"name\":\"Maciej Barczewski\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2129550,\"name\":\"Katarzyna Gałązka\",\"character\":\"Ala\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tCqLF94CMC8XudWZeus0krIkHwi.jpg\"},{\"id\":2098904,\"name\":\"Karolina Bruchnicka\",\"character\":\"Lena\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":4611691,\"name\":\"Tymoteusz Frączek\",\"character\":\"Chester\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1065359,\"name\":\"Grzegorz Damięcki\",\"character\":\"Ala's Father\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bDc90Cbe3QkagE4UcF4aUtJm0a6.jpg\"},{\"id\":1482162,\"name\":\"Mateusz Kościukiewicz\",\"character\":\"Hector\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yrlP8XhIUxvrvTAViAZukpycvxX.jpg\"},{\"id\":1668585,\"name\":\"Marek Kalita\",\"character\":\"Colonel\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4c8gMUQ6BP2qOQ9kckMa88mcbNI.jpg\"},{\"id\":4611692,\"name\":\"Adam Stasiak\",\"character\":\"Adam\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jGySZ2qWQAfkOnZm4JMqcGXc7fL.jpg\"},{\"id\":3185484,\"name\":\"Michał Karmowski\",\"character\":\"Senior Officer\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/f5KVKI4CzWqVeI6N4DUXbUemUr8.jpg\"},{\"id\":3475609,\"name\":\"Lena Hamouda\",\"character\":\"Lena (child)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9gwImw3yLrraxsJfDLF41PlRIFk.jpg\"},{\"id\":4715648,\"name\":\"Sunny Kandelucky\",\"character\":\"Ala (child)\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2204444,\"name\":\"Jacek Król\",\"character\":\"Chester's Father\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7zgFyjOQ0G1Zbh3Iru3RRGS5HZO.jpg\"},{\"id\":2532461,\"name\":\"Anna Kociarz\",\"character\":\"Russian Teacher\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4XbarlQvoU6FaUva3cZxvVBNYUv.jpg\"},{\"id\":3250447,\"name\":\"Joanna Żurawska-Federowicz\",\"character\":\"Biology Teacher\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vGhPmWD2G56HvCWwn5hNBvZ489u.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1327819,\"title\":\"Hoppers\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xjtWQ2CL1mpmMNwuU5HeS4Iuwuu.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u53UYu5XG2hNgWGvs3xGhAVzypl.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Scientists have discovered how to 'hop' human consciousness into lifelike robotic animals, allowing people to communicate with animals as animals. Animal lover Mabel seizes an opportunity to use the technology, uncovering mysteries within the animal world beyond anything she could have imagined.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1184918,\"title\":\"The Wild Robot\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wTnV3PCVW5O92JMrFvvrRcV39RU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1pmXyN3sKeYoUhu5VBZiDU4BX21.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a shipwreck, an intelligent robot called Roz is stranded on an uninhabited island. To survive the harsh environment, Roz bonds with the island's animals and cares for an orphaned baby goose.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Animation\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":278154,\"title\":\"Ice Age: Collision Course\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tFzUkdhPOForVrEfvxydXfPLrZR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rBEH34dgPMy1WuqZ0AFXR2ThmNo.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Set after the events of Continental Drift, Scrat's epic pursuit of his elusive acorn catapults him outside of Earth, where he accidentally sets off a series of cosmic events that transform and threaten the planet. To save themselves from peril, Manny, Sid, Diego, and the rest of the herd leave their home and embark on a quest full of thrills and spills, highs and lows, laughter and adventure while traveling to exotic new lands and locations.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":698687,\"title\":\"Transformers One\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iRCgqpdVE4wyLQvGYU3ZP7pAtUc.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gfxGibm7hpZxqPl5DOb95QmHy2g.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The untold origin story of Optimus Prime and Megatron, better known as sworn enemies, but once were friends bonded like brothers who changed the fate of Cybertron forever.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9016,\"title\":\"Treasure Planet\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kNhZkR3UNbXfvESQo7mJpOi4tGd.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f2opsSUSiMdEp6AiY2sbC8QPd8S.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When space galleon cabin boy Jim Hawkins discovers a map to an intergalactic \\\"loot of a thousand worlds,\\\" a cyborg cook named John Silver teaches him to battle supernovas and space storms on their journey to find treasure.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\",\"Animation\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":404368,\"title\":\"Ralph Breaks the Internet\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iVCrhBcpDaHGvv7CLYbK6PuXZo1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qDQEQbgP3v7B9IYLAUcYexNrVYP.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Video game bad guy Ralph and fellow misfit Vanellope von Schweetz must risk it all by traveling to the World Wide Web in search of a replacement part to save Vanellope's video game, Sugar Rush. In way over their heads, Ralph and Vanellope rely on the citizens of the internet — the netizens — to help navigate their way, including an entrepreneur named Yesss, who is the head algorithm and the heart and soul of trend-making site BuzzzTube.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":893723,\"title\":\"PAW Patrol: The Mighty Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aTvePCU7exLepwg5hWySjwxojQK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zgQQF04u3OgNBJqClRNby1FPz9s.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A magical meteor crash lands in Adventure City and gives the PAW Patrol pups superpowers, transforming them into The Mighty Pups.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":15512,\"title\":\"Monsters vs Aliens\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hpHarddVj34j53T7NsoUGdKj4mP.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fbxZeJEcyf76oEQIGmotlclwmiH.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Susan Murphy is unwittingly clobbered by a meteor full of outer space gunk on her wedding day, she mysteriously grows to 49-feet-11-inches. The military jumps into action and captures Susan, secreting her away to a covert government compound. She is renamed Ginormica and placed in confinement with a ragtag group of Monsters...\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1022787,\"title\":\"Elio\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7z8jDiTZZco9moIKpTUImFtTy7o.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ukPu5xYOBAnh5H46uK4aQOirW2b.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Elio, a space fanatic with an active imagination, finds himself on a cosmic misadventure where he must form new bonds with eccentric alien lifeforms, navigate a crisis of intergalactic proportions and somehow discover who he is truly meant to be.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1267,\"title\":\"Meet the Robinsons\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/naya0zF4kT401Sx15AtwB9vpcJr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AsWuvFnzgmG6kZMIpJO7HZpvYRB.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Lewis, a brilliant young inventor, is keen on creating a time machine to find his mother, who abandoned him in an orphanage. Things take a turn when he meets Wilbur Robinson and his family.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":718789,\"title\":\"Lightyear\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ox4goZd956BxqJH6iLwhWPL9ct4.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hwUxHPkuUleJeoick4uZsrKDXxF.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Legendary Space Ranger Buzz Lightyear embarks on an intergalactic adventure alongside a group of ambitious recruits and his robot companion Sox.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":158852,\"title\":\"Tomorrowland\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kziYpr5Nfw60P0My8aj1sgCEqed.jpg\"